  "query": "-- Every workflow the server applied for a tenant, in name order, bounded by the most a\n-- branch holds plus one row that tells a larger set apart.\nSELECT workflow, n8n_workflow_id, file_sha256, n8n_version_id, runnable, applied\nFROM n8n.applied_workflow\nWHERE tenant = $1\nORDER BY workflow\nLIMIT $2\n",
